er mining town","legend":"Ponatum is a mining town of 13088 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker6","name":"Nymphicos — iron mining town","legend":"Nymphicos is a mining town of 4626 people just nearby the iron mine."},{"id":"marker7","name":"Aliscom Bridge","legend":"A rickety bridge spans over the Fensey Fork near Aliscom."},{"id":"marker8","name":"Heung Bridge","legend":"A stone bridge spans over the Samcheong River near Heung."},{"id":"marker9","name":"The Brown Eagle","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious dry-aged pie with red gin is served here."},{"id":"marker10","name":"The Grey Ibis","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious syrupped tomatoes with black brandy is served here."},{"id":"marker11","name":"The Big Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious deep-fried pudding with smoky nectar is served here."},{"id":"marker12","name":"The Great Owl","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious grilled eggs with bitter rom is served here."},{"id":"marker13","name":"The Bright Raven","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious cured peaches with bitter wine is served here."},{"id":"marker14","name":"The Dark Ibis","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious pickled bread with light gin is served here."},{"id":"marker15","name":"The Lucky Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious fried duck with green kvass is served here."},{"id":"marker16","name":"The Great Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dried pig ears with white juice is served here."},{"id":"marker17","name":"Okoenets Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker18","name":"Lurymock Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker19","name":"Hwang Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Cheongdan War. \r\nDate: February 9, 765 Song Era."},{"id":"marker20","name":"Nytos Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Loian Campaign. \r\nDate: May 18, 632 Song Era."},{"id":"marker21","name":"Sizhers Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Loian Invasion. \r\nDate: May 30, 649 Song Era."},{"id":"marker22","name":"Mabingley Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Cleorean Conflict. \r\nDate: November 24, 914 Song Era."},{"id":"marker23","name":"Kizen Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Asibesenelian Invasion. \r\nDate: April 20, 885 Song Era."},{"id":"marker24","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9604540167037\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9604540167037\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker25","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9604540165791\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9604540165791\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker26","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9604540163642\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9604540163642\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker27","name":"Hamyeol Monster","legend":"Locals say a relic monster of 8 m long inhabits Hamyeol Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Viazhesk Monster","legend":"Elders say a relic monster of 5 m long inhabits Viazhesk Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Congton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 38 m long."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Sudley Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 45 m long."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Atarea Roc","legend":"Legends speak of a huge Roc who inhabits Atarea hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Kiyododoma Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Yamoto Spirits."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Thinnoya Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Norse Spirits."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Berereres Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Mererech Church."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Pyeon Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Koryo Beliefs."},{"id":"marker36","name":"Cythopodo Bisons","legend":"A gang of desert brigands."},{"id":"marker37","name":"Usloch Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker38","name":"Hodok Jaguars","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker39","name":"Propogo Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker40","name":"Chang Wolverines","legend":"A gang of swamp bandits."},{"id":"marker41","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker42","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker43","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Tabingra Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠኀ ገሐሠ ዐጸ ዘሐየነረአከሠፐየሀለ ረደመ ሰበጠየገቀ ቀደሀገሀፈደዘዘበጠበደጠፐጠሰከፐዘገሀለየዘሠጸጠጠወ ሠአለነጸበጸየሀደዐመአአከሀፀዘሰወሰወ</div>"},{"id":"marker46","name":"Skropastad Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ሐአገዘተጸጸየነመፐወ ጸበሀጰወሠ ሠለጸአበ ወሠለጠከሐ  ዐሐሠወጸገረሰ መመከበሐ ኀደ ፐጰረፐኀ መጠነ</div>"},{"id":"marker47","name":"Dobermers Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༡༤༯༿༡༠༊༷༄༥༚༛༣༛༕༈༼༼༁༲༘༐༷༂༪༱༗༴༡༜༆༄༶༰༓༌༗༴༙༾༫༵༾༼༬༒༉༿༖༱ༀ༧༵༇༻༧༈༱༨</div>"},{"id":"marker48","name":"Bromer Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጠበአቀፀሀ ለደኀጰፈሰበ ኀጰነተ ሀለለፐነጸኀወ ሀ ዐሐየ ደፀዘኀ </div>"},{"id":"marker49","name":"Hafting Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሐጰፈ ረ ደአቀ ለነቀፐአጰወአከነረኀ ኀለፈጠሐለ ነነተለፈደጸፈበነረወቀሀደጸወፐፐሐተ ገተ ዘ</div>"},{"id":"marker50","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker51","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Hertley Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Klyatin Joust","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a joust of might in Klyatin, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Eplios Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Eplios, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Yeong River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Foxes migration","legend":"A huge group of foxes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Hvekurfika carnival","legend":"A carnival has been organised at Hvekurfika as a chance to gather the foreign dignitaries of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Gendaibet Fracture","legend":"The Gendaibet Fracture. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Lidychev Crypt","legend":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/83\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker68","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2031\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker69","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/5674\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker70","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/5881\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker71","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2565\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker72","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/388\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker73","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/7697\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker74","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/18\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker75","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/787\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker76","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/6044\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker77","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered 